<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES RESULT.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in a Supersport series cricket match which ended on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In East London: Border beat Transvaal by five wickets. Transvaal 291 and 162 (M.Benfield 53, P.Botha 4-47), Border 319-8 dec and 135-5.</p>
</text>
